g them here but he's trying  to do all this with a comfortable rhythm  as he says so he's clearly holding back  he's practicing control as they struggle  for their lives and even says he plans  to kill billions after this so he can't  get tired this early on so yeah if  homeless emperor has his way sounds like  he's going after the entire population  of the world so as often is the case  with superhero stories our heroes are  literally once again standing between  the monsters and the end of the world  and if homeless emperor can back up his  claims then he's obviously a threat to  the survival of humanity and thus by  definition a god level threat but  whether anyone here actually is a god  level threat i'll let you guys discuss  that in the comments in the meantime we  catch up with atomic samurai who is  planning on unsheathing the sun's sword  in the flashback it's called a  telepathic sword that judges the wielder  to decide if they are worthy of it  lending its power to them if you aren't  accepted you can't take out the sword  from the sheath absolutely love this  king arthur-esque detail i gotta say  this side story is almost too good for a  side character i usually feel like a  main character should have such hyped up  power-ups but i'm not complaining this  is one of my favorite aspects of the  story right now but if this was demon  slayer this would definitely be a main  character related thing just saying  anyways back to the insanely interesting  sword story atomic samurai laughs in the  flashback saying it sounds like a myth  or even like a fairy tale and if  monsters espers and superheroes weren't  running around i might feel the same way  we jump back to the prez as homeless  emperor goes to drop a giant energy orb  on them as atomic samurai is trying to  communicate with the sword and figure  out what it wants bang crosses his mind  the master that he considers to be his  rival i really love this aspect too and  it's another example of how one punch  man incorporates a long line of martial  arts stories and histories into its own  story atomic samurai pictures what  bang's mentality would be if it was a  stream of water and the state of mind  would be a reflective water surface  which of course suggests calm and  control atomic samurai reaches for that  unparalleled level of concentration and  the sun blade responds like arthur  pulling the sword from the stone except  even more epic it starts to emerge from  the sheath his speed seems to increase  dramatically too to the shock of the  bystanders as he moves quickly to cut up  and destroy homeless emperor's massive  energy sphere which he does very  successfully and very quickly we get an  image of him with the sword of light and  he looks reminiscent of yorichi and  dimitsare and his eyes will definitely  remind you of garo here as well not sure  if this is a straight up demonstrator  reference or if they're just working  with the same japanese myths but  nonetheless i'm loving it atomic  samurai's level of strength here is no  doubt monstrous the sword seems to be  merging with his hand and bringing out  his body's max potential none of  homeless emperor's attacks work against  atomic samurai and homeless emperor is  only saved from being sliced up because  the insanely powerful golden s comes  between them to take the attack now  golden s has been hyped up big time even  if you don't consider him a god level  threat which is one thing he is still  way way stronger than an average dragon  level threat that can't be denied to  golden s atomic samurai looks like he  might have undergone monsterization but  then says no this sword must be the  reason he decides to try to break it and  his arm gets sliced off this an  absolutely insane development he  comments that his right arm of 12  trillion cells has been cut off this is  a big reveal too because there was a  question of whether or not this golden s  had less cells than in the webcomic but  now it's revealed that he clearly has  more in the webcomic there were less  than 11.5 trillion cells but now just  golden s without all the yet to be fused  black s's and there's a lot of them has  more and yet atomic samurai slices him  easily with the sun blade an utterly  shocking development i gotta say i did  not care about atomic samurai that much  in the web comic but his storyline right  now is one of the most interesting ones  in the manga think about what will  happen if he gets the moon blade too and  uses them simultaneously we're talking  way beyond bang and tatsumaki power easy  despite the fact that he's currently  only ranked number four of course such  insane power must come with a catch  especially when it happens so quickly  and there does appear to be a time limit  for now the sword goes back into the  sheath and atomic samurai is brought to  his knees from utter exhaustion he says  he got assimilated with the blade and it  completely took over his spirit so it  sounds like a sort of blade avatar state  which is amazing and the eyes were even  similar too it's like when zenitsu falls  asleep you don't want to mess with  anyone with those eyes again i  definitely didn't see it coming that  atomic samurai would cut up golden s and  that's just with one of the two blades  atomic samurai will definitely be one of  the characters to watch as things move  forward and of course it should always  be kept in mind when a character can't  maintain a special form or state for  long when comparing them to other  characters but at the end of the day an  op form even if it lasts only one minute  is always more hype than if a dude is  just okay strong for an extended period  of time that's just the way it works and  shonen just look at baryon mode however  the limit is coming into play already  here in the story as homeless emperor  and golden s realized that now is the  time to strike him down they can tell  that atomic samurai is completely  depleted and he even says something i  remember straight out of the webcomic  goldeness says that all the heroes who  are still alive should form a line and  wait for their turn to get killed love  this antagonist's arrogance i gotta say  especially after getting his arm cut off  but then the sound is heard and they  witness king looking down on them in  epic fashion it's such a morale boost  like goku himself just made it to the  scene all the heroes including genos  think they are saved the black s's  comment that this is troublesome as they  heard he destroyed elder centipede with  a single attack which was of course  saitama metal bat is here too but since  he sees kang he thinks that everything  will be fine he'll just stay back and  let king do his thing while he takes  care of any black s's that try to get in  the way a black s actually calls him out  saying it's going to be satisfying to  beat up the world's strongest human and  hilariously enough golden s the  strongest one is the one to tell him to  wait a minute they shouldn't be hasty  because the one in front of them is the  hero association's strongest fighter we  see that atomic samurai just took his  arm off and so it makes sense that he'd  be cautious around the guy who's  supposed to be much stronger golden s  goes on to say he is king the greatest  obstacle they should be more cautious  than with tatsumaki at full power golden  s tells them to do it together meaning  he might want all the remaining black  s's to fuse with him making the ultimate  goldeness or even platinum s who knows  in the manga and that should heal his  missing arm too in the meantime king is  hilariously panicking in his head as  usual as the enemies think he's laughing  at them and looking down at them king  thinks if only saitama was here and then  as if an answer to his prayer and as if  pulling our collective chains too king  hears what he thinks is saitama coming  to the rescue and then we're all  disappointed together when we see child  emperor and puri